      "severity": "high",
      "scope": ".opencode/plans/ses_0599b2df7ffehr8YtTQ8wwu2kg-fix-plan-review-stop-rules/spec.md",
      "description": "A headless planner that discovers an unresolved product choice required to define an observable locked test receives contradictory instructions. `headless-product-tradeoff` requires every product trade-off without a technical resolution to become an explicit PR risk, while #ac-2.2 and Constraints require this specific class to block and be reported rather than carried forward. The implementation therefore cannot deterministically choose whether to stop before planning or proceed toward a PR.",
